  <item>
    <title>41 这混乱又离谱的美好毕业季啊</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/665308e8c59d1e5757c0f7f4</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">665308e8c59d1e5757c0f7f4</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 26 May 2024 14:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>欢迎再次来到半面镜子！去年快结束的时候酝酿了一个念头，并付诸实际获得了至今觉得很宝贵的体验。但处在混乱转折期的自己，因为内心无法确定而抓不住确定的东西，造成了现在的处境——仍在非确定中。</span></p><span></span><p><span>那么，本期长节目来浅聊以下24年前五个月的故事吧。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="170">02:50</a> 一个去北京短暂生活的念头的落地</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="390">06:30</a> 和线上好友们在冬季奔赴见面</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="795">13:15</a> 实习也遇到了超nice的人儿</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1035">17:15</a> 骄傲！每周给镜子菜谱丰富+1</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1175">19:35</a> 面对24年的第一场告别</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1275">21:15</a> 匆匆忙忙回家过年</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1570">26:10</a> 每年都感受到大家细微的变化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1727">28:47</a> 妈妈和我都可以去见自己的朋友</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2528">42:08</a> 春节堵车解锁追尾经历</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2650">44:10</a> 年后上班，疲惫</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2720">45:20</a> 组里团建的故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3060">51:00</a> 关于是否转正的纠结故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3760">62:40</a> 感受后、离开北京</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3906">65:06</a> 吐槽中间剧场</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4070">67:50</a> 感谢这段宝贵经历！！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4360">72:40</a> 五一回南方依然匆忙</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4860">81:00</a> 改签也赶不上高铁的假J人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5132">85:32</a> 我怎么到了现在这个境地</span></p><span></span><p><span>抓住主线，保持学习和成长，好事总会发生在下一个转弯。下次见，生活顺利！</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期音乐：</span></p><span></span><p><span>月光（伴奏）by于适</span></p><span></span><p><span>Rebecca by蔡健雅</span></p><span></span><p><span>Hey Hey You by蔡健雅</span></p><span></span><p><span>青い栞 by Galileo Galilei</span></p><span></span><p><span>善良的我们 by蔡健雅</span></p><span></span><p><span>痛苦拥抱 by Ozone</span></p><span></span><p><span>Moving On by陈宇祥</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lmUusPSxjJGxQDQ_BFl48FNgr6xD.m4a" length="137729493" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:34:54</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ft8mplsi4-TLGrCtMW5p6ZEQPEw-.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>40 留校备考平凡生活记</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/655d85bd0500be931ce93265</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">655d85bd0500be931ce93265</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 22 Nov 2023 11:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>当状态改换，没有了表达的出口，成为校园里独行的普通人，迎接从秋到冬的转换，感受一周又一周没有大起落的平凡时间流逝。谈不上是否不快乐，偶尔有些在做事的填充感，又是一期生活回顾记，记录多让人觉得珍贵呀。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="85">01:25</a> 前情提要：装腔启示录/国庆休假/朋友圈保研冲击/家的现实与学校的自在/</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="494">08:14</a> 常规周报：实习/备考/体测/混乱/规律</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1402">23:22</a> 新奇遇：碰到三位新朋友</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1577">26:17</a> 感受到幸福的瞬间：晒太阳！花玻璃光！栗子鸡汤！线上演唱会！自然观察！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2152">35:52</a> 当表达没有了出口，生活没了切割口</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2222">37:02</a> 过上了追综不阅读的大学生活</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2494">41:34</a> 大四生碰到大一生</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2751">45:51</a> 听课有感-从历史的角度看、人好像会变得豁然</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3050">50:50</a> 我发现我不会秋招</span></p><span></span><p><span>冬天也会有暖意充盈的时刻，感受冬季，静待春的来临。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期音乐：</span></p><span></span><p><span>十点半的地铁 by李健</span></p><span></span><p><span>Living In The Moment by Jason Mraz</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/llxLgK_ymRVxAXLqlY1KtoJzSCPW.m4a" length="84905509" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:58:30</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZnSnFETTIwSVB0dlMxWDRUTDA5NWxmLW5JZUcucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>39 实习日记下篇，思考更多关于工作</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65294dc3ba2ed85c6d276aa2</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65294dc3ba2ed85c6d276aa2</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 14 Oct 2023 10:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>实习语音日记如期更新，褪去刚开始一个多月的新鲜，熟悉后公司各种事件的发生，外加秋招季关于毕业工作的选择困惑，都将在本期有所涉及。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="70">01:10</a>快速顺一遍每周历程</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="678">11:18</a>实习生也有双节礼盒</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1082">18:02</a>选择现有的还是可能受挫的新岗位？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1151">19:11</a>学历在分工上的体现</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1292">21:32</a>简单的逻辑在现实中并不适用</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1498">24:58</a>母婴博主，关于生育与工作的思考</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1907">31:47</a>临毕业秋招关于职业选择的困惑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2266">37:46</a>二十多岁迷茫说明还有没被定性的自由</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2389">39:49</a>题外话</span></p><span></span><p><span>那么，下次不定期再见~</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期音乐：ふたりby SixTONES</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lp1Lad3PG4IMLERYBG3oW2NSEG6-.m4a" length="63542897" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:43:46</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0Z0M2RsaGVBTXpfa0RpcXYwclI1Y0dJeTVvWW8ucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
