  <item>
    <title>38 不忙于限定，而是探索更多可能性</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/650c4bda5c88d241267f2513</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">650c4bda5c88d241267f2513</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 23 Sep 2023 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>人为什么总要被限定于某个阶段做某个事情，以至于当非确定性出现便开始心绪波动。在愿意浪费的时间里，给出一定的自由度，或许可以探索更多奇妙的可能性。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="218">03:38</a>寝室重聚发觉，我骨子里还是一个i人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="556">09:16</a>要毕业了大家开始爱学习了？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="642">10:42</a>面对突如其来的父母热情不知所措</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="891">14:51</a>思想输出了，行动上仍然招架不住</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1020">17:00</a>逛本地公园、看小学放学</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1392">23:12</a>第一次看路演犯花痴</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1680">28:00</a>切实地给明星这份职业祛魅</span></p><span></span><p><span>期待更多走出去尝试去遇见可能性的奇遇，也在时不时地与限定时钟博弈。我们下期，放假再见！</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期音乐：一半人生by五月天 阿信</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lkSmUFzq2wKloz80nINrQrXBwItj.m4a" length="48278309" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:33:15</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L2x1OS1uY2lwS2VuUTRka0EyVTk5X0NQYk92NWkucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>37 友谊特辑|如果一睁眼便是十年后</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65005677e490c5dee50a9f74</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65005677e490c5dee50a9f74</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 17 Sep 2023 02:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>如果一睁眼便是十年后，我们该如何定义这一场持续至十年的友谊？欢迎来到本期友谊特辑，聊聊有关长期朋友的故事。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="103">01:43</a>我们的十年，从初中到大学</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="815">13:35</a>十年之际的相处状态</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="981">16:21</a>气场温和、坚定输出</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1114">18:34</a>比我更成熟和冷静</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1324">22:04</a>超强的时间管理能力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1469">24:29</a>彼此同频下的丰富差异</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1930">32:10</a>总有人得为i做e</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2021">33:41</a>内外向人格的转换与忽视的敏感点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2133">35:33</a>在事件摩擦中磨合出特有的相处模式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2346">39:06</a>生日祝福彩蛋</span></p><span></span><p><span>未来已来，继续彼此倾诉着、兴致盎然地与更广阔的世界交手，万事胜意。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期音乐：</span></p><span></span><p><span>十年by陈奕迅</span></p><span></span><p><span>一期一会by周深</span></p><span></span><p><span>secret base ~君がくれたもの~ by茅野愛衣 戸松遥 早見沙織</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lqVUp5LZP4LEUQxEVLRKtSqVndXZ.m4a" length="62198613" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:42:51</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZuVV9CV3JGaVlUNVNIY0dhVVNwYzdoUjVOaEUucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
