  <item>
    <title>36 您好，我不同阶段的老师</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64fc77d93fa4090b7497ab56</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64fc77d93fa4090b7497ab56</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 10 Sep 2023 01:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>老师们一届一届地累积学生，而学生在每个阶段却只有特定的老师。恰逢教师节，来聊聊作为学生阶段遇到的老师们。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="67">01:07</a>小学老师像母亲哄小孩一样</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="230">03:50</a>课本里一样关爱学生的班主任</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="520">08:40</a>被学生气哭＆把学生凶哭的语文老师</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="793">13:13</a>教学游刃有余且松弛有度的英语老师</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="980">16:20</a>高中普遍敬业辛苦的老师们</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1457">24:17</a>大学老师分化各异</span></p><span></span><p><span>是属于老师们的节日，送上祝福，想怎么过都不为过。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期音乐：半边山半边海by 陈楚生/王铮亮</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lpB13w_Hp26Bi8cqZt96zzgVR_Ds.m4a" length="50820941" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:35:01</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZueUtVVUlYdDk3czZva0N6LW5adWZ4elBHWFEucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>35 夏季总结|谁在影响我做什么样的事</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64e9c2e13fa4090b744f2ce6</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64e9c2e13fa4090b744f2ce6</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 27 Aug 2023 02:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>是三点一线的实习夏季，</span></p><span></span><p><span>是情绪蔓延的追星夏季，</span></p><span></span><p><span>是观他窥自的感想夏季，</span></p><span></span><p><span>是一场多彩无悔的夏季经历。</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎一起来听，</span><strong><span>这个夏天的片段感</span></strong><span>！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="61">01:01</a>躲不掉的同辈压力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="353">05:53</a>大家的方向可能并不相同</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="530">08:50</a>我们是如何被大学的氛围PUA的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1009">16:49</a>年轻人会慢慢从自媒体回归固定上班生活</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1330">22:10</a>单凭热情是很难坚持的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1469">24:29</a>不可避免被商品化地衡量</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1750">29:10</a>看到好的摄影照片还是会感动</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1846">30:46</a>总有一些惊奇的际遇</span></p><span></span><p><span>打包概括：电梯被困/午夜公交/暴雨溅水/多次中暑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2529">42:09</a>非虚构成长，十年之约</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2829">47:09</a>八月初的西安像一个盛大的限定主题乐园</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2886">48:06</a>追星的意义：在于陪伴和思想同频的成长</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3007">50:07</a>警惕成为精致而速朽的模子，向内生长，善良坦荡</span></p><span></span><p><span>给不算四处游荡的夏天来一个总结，也是值得记住的美好日子。下期见啦~</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期音乐：</span></p><span></span><p><span>不完美小孩/小精灵/我们的时光/大梦想家/Heart/最好的那年by TFBOYS</span></p><span></span><p><span>冷静和热情之间by 易烊千玺</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lh9NEAlatOlcaBt7kPnQEW4gAuha.m4a" length="82216585" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:56:39</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZvUm96ekNRS3VPQTVYNUNnQUtTaHppRE50cW8ucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>34 实习，更适合大学生的托管所</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64e08cc080c9ec4c5fb3d905</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64e08cc080c9ec4c5fb3d905</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 19 Aug 2023 14:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;从今年开始对实习有了一点莫名的向往，于是暑假正式开始每天规律上下班的实习生活。像是打开了新的经历宝箱，随着时间的增长得到愈多的小宝物。</span></p><span></span><p><span>-历程分享-</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="199">03:19</a>每周主题叙述</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="433">07:13</a>第二周就开始腰背不适</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="772">12:52</a>关于做饭新挑战的碎碎念</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1209">20:09</a>三周养成了上班的习惯，但是损耗了情感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1528">25:28</a>不填满计划表才感到生活气息</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1580">26:20</a>重获新生的第五周</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1765">29:25</a>担心自己是不是能给公司创造价值</span></p><span></span><p><span>-感受小述-</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2210">36:50</a>工作真的会占据大部分白天时间</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2359">39:19</a>可不可以只上三五个小时的班</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2461">41:01</a>有的时候也很依赖这一份工作的固定感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2716">45:16</a>萌生了独立去外地实习的想法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2920">48:40</a>另一方面，要不要珍惜规划最后的校园生活</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3100">51:40</a>主动提薪资好像变成了难以开口的事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3390">56:30</a>实习内容有感</span></p><span></span><p><span>实习还在继续中，继续感受。下期见！</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期音乐：真夏の果実by EXILE</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lgCHQ-aKGMB9etw0PxPWAASIty1V.m4a" length="87390933" type="audio/mp4"/>
