  <item>
    <title>27 三月总结|不知不觉已经经历了这么多事儿啦</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/642996541a5480d95857d91b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">642996541a5480d95857d91b</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 02 Apr 2023 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>一期三月总结奉上，一个多月的信息密度比一整个暑假的密度还要高，这个学上得真是不错。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="63">01:03</a>新学期新状态：精致过好每一天</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="308">05:08</a>一次去绍兴的双人旅行</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1045">17:25</a>科二的练车初体验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1340">22:20</a>拍证件照、做简历、找实习的流程尝试</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1690">28:10</a>三月某一周关键词：脱口秀</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2075">34:35</a>相对稳定、愉悦的持续状态</span></p><span></span><p><span>朋友们！趁着天气好该出去就出去，好好感受春天呀！</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期音乐：Une Hirondelle A Fait Le Printemps（独燕成春）</span></p>]]></description>
